&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;430&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is seeking an experienced and collaborative Regional Security Manager to lead physical security operations across the Americas (AMER) region. Reporting to the Director, Global Security Operations, this role will oversee a team responsible for regional security programs, incident response, crisis support, and operational readiness across SIE offices, studios, and events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;835&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate brings strong operational leadership, sound judgment, and the ability to build trusted partnerships across a global organization. This position plays a key role in helping create safe, secure, and resilient environments for employees, visitors, and business operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1j5ac4d&quot; data-start=&quot;1126&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;Regional Security Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1178&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wwvqat&quot; data-start=&quot;1178&quot; data-end=&quot;1262&quot;&gt;Lead and support a regional team of security professionals across the AMER region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1krr0bo&quot; data-start=&quot;1263&quot; data-end=&quot;1376&quot;&gt;Partner with global security teams to help maintain consistent standards, processes, and operational practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vkl03y&quot; data-start=&quot;1377&quot; data-end=&quot;1488&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development and execution of regional security strategies aligned with business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16ekiz5&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1597&quot;&gt;Use metrics and operational insights to evaluate effectiveness and identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13j44kg&quot; data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;Support budget planning, resource management, and vendor oversight within the security function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;Physical Security Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1731&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;54dj91&quot; data-start=&quot;1731&quot; data-end=&quot;1830&quot;&gt;Oversee physical security programs, policies, and procedures across offices and studio locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uyta6q&quot; data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1940&quot;&gt;Conduct risk assessments and coordinate security reviews to identify and address potential vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tbwsjx&quot; data-start=&quot;1941&quot; data-end=&quot;2059&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders and external partners to strengthen site security and emergency preparedness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ljpbi7&quot; data-start=&quot;2060&quot; data-end=&quot;2182&quot;&gt;Manage third-party security providers to ensure quality service delivery and alignment with organizational expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xqaw74&quot; data-start=&quot;2183&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;Provide guidance and operational support to regional sites on security best practices and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2288&quot; data-end=&quot;2318&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2288&quot; data-end=&quot;2318&quot;&gt;Incident &amp;amp; Crisis Response&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2319&quot; data-end=&quot;2826&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bn2lc7&quot; data-start=&quot;2319&quot; data-end=&quot;2406&quot;&gt;Lead or support responses to workplace security incidents and safety-related matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18ym1uq&quot; data-start=&quot;2407&quot; data-end=&quot;2525&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Workplace, Legal, HR/People, and other teams to support investigations and incident management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1saltol&quot; data-start=&quot;2526&quot; data-end=&quot;2628&quot;&gt;Prepare clear documentation, reporting, and recommendations following incidents or security reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gst6j0&quot; data-start=&quot;2629&quot; data-end=&quot;2719&quot;&gt;Support emergency planning activities, tabletop exercises, and preparedness initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x1grdk&quot; data-start=&quot;2720&quot; data-end=&quot;2826&quot;&gt;Coordinate response efforts during significant incidents impacting employees, facilities, or operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2828&quot; data-end=&quot;2846&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2828&quot; data-end=&quot;2846&quot;&gt;Event Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2847&quot; data-end=&quot;3140&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d0kw7t&quot; data-start=&quot;2847&quot; data-end=&quot;2964&quot;&gt;Support security planning and operational readiness for PlayStation events, activations, and executive engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ciu9w9&quot; data-start=&quot;2965&quot; data-end=&quot;3051&quot;&gt;Conduct event-related risk assessments and coordinate appropriate security measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;aku2ac&quot; data-start=&quot;3052&quot; data-end=&quot;3140&quot;&gt;Provide on-site leadership and incident management support during key regional events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3142&quot; data-end=&quot;3175&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3142&quot; data-end=&quot;3175&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3176&quot; data-end=&quot;3528&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19ma2vd&quot; data-start=&quot;3176&quot; data-end=&quot;3277&quot;&gt;Build strong partnerships with teams across HR, IT, Workplace, Legal, and other business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t43hp7&quot; data-start=&quot;3278&quot; data-end=&quot;3380&quot;&gt;Communicate regularly with leadership regarding security priorities, risks, and operational updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lcchsw&quot; data-start=&quot;3381&quot; data-end=&quot;3528&quot;&gt;Maintain relationships with industry peers, security organizations, and external partners to stay informed on emerging trends and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;ebiqzw&quot; data-start=&quot;3530&quot; data-end=&quot;3556&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3557&quot; data-end=&quot;4380&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bdrbh&quot; data-start=&quot;3557&quot; data-end=&quot;3732&quot;&gt;8+ years of experience in physical security, corporate security operations, investigations, law enforcement, military, intelligence, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uqxn0e&quot; data-start=&quot;3733&quot; data-end=&quot;3826&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience managing security initiatives across multiple locations or regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wat937&quot; data-start=&quot;3827&quot; data-end=&quot;3917&quot;&gt;Strong leadership and people management skills, including coaching and team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;crk8cn&quot; data-start=&quot;3918&quot; data-end=&quot;4028&quot;&gt;Ability to assess complex situations, make informed decisions, and communicate effectively during incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uym8ae&quot; data-start=&quot;4029&quot; data-end=&quot;4124&quot;&gt;Excellent collaboration and stakeholder management skills across diverse teams and functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a6gb4e&quot; data-start=&quot;4125&quot; data-end=&quot;4203&quot;&gt;Experience managing vendors, contractors, or third-party security providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;daqbey&quot; data-start=&quot;4204&quot; data-end=&quot;4292&quot;&gt;Familiarity with crisis management, emergency response, and event security operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dz6z7x&quot; data-start=&quot;4293&quot; data-end=&quot;4380&quot;&gt;Flexibility to support occasional evening/weekend work and regional travel as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;fktgjl&quot; data-start=&quot;4382&quot; data-end=&quot;4410&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4411&quot; data-end=&quot;4755&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h90c8i&quot; data-start=&quot;4411&quot; data-end=&quot;4503&quot;&gt;Experience in technology, gaming, entertainment, or other fast-paced global organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hjwhpd&quot; data-start=&quot;4504&quot; data-end=&quot;4601&quot;&gt;Industry certifications such as CPP (Certified Protection Professional) or similar credentials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pvljpv&quot; data-start=&quot;4602&quot; data-end=&quot;4755&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Criminal Justice, Security Management, Emergency Management, Business, or a related field — or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;48&quot; data-end=&quot;61&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This position can be based in one of our California offices, including San Mateo, San Diego, Aliso Viejo, or Los Angeles.&lt;br data-start=&quot;170&quot; data-end=&quot;173&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;173&quot; data-end=&quot;194&quot;&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hybrid role with an expectation to work in-office on average 2 days per week&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-GM1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At SIE, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the base pay range may vary in line with our hybrid working policy and individual base pay will be determined based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;is eligible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; for SIE’s top-tier benefits package that includes medical, dental, vision, matching 401(k), paid time off, wellness program and coveted employee discounts for Sony products. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role also may be eligible for a bonus package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.playstation.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to learn more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$226,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
